{"seq":3,"slug":"rotation-modes","title":"旋转模式：北向固定与随人旋转的取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-minimap-systems/rendering/rotation-modes","wordCount":1652,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"旋转模式-北向固定与随人旋转的取舍\">旋转模式：北向固定与随人旋转的取舍</h1><p>一个玩家转身向左，小地图该怎么反应？两派做法针锋相对：北向固定派让地图纹丝不动、只让玩家箭头转向左边；随人旋转派让整张地图顺时针转起来，让玩家永远「朝上」。这个看似微不足道的开关，牵动玩家的寻路效率、空间记忆、甚至眩晕感，是小地图设计里争论最久的问题之一。这一篇把两种模式的数学、体验差异和实现坑讲清楚。它接续 <a href=\"projection-scaling\">投影与缩放</a> 变换链里被跳过的「第二步旋转」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种模式的定义与数学\">核心概念：两种模式的定义与数学</h2><p>先厘清定义。<strong>北向固定（north-up / fixed）</strong>：地图方向恒定，通常北在上，玩家在地图上是一个会转向的箭头，箭头指向玩家实际朝向。<strong>随人旋转（rotate-with-player / heading-up / track-up）</strong>：玩家朝向恒定指向屏幕正上方，整张地图反向旋转以补偿玩家的转身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家朝向 θ 变化] --&gt; B{旋转模式}&#10;  B --&gt;|北向固定| C[地图不动]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[玩家箭头旋转到 θ]&#10;  B --&gt;|随人旋转| D[地图整体旋转 -θ]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[玩家箭头恒定朝上]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[所有标记需反向旋转补偿朝向]\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家朝向 θ 变化] --&gt; B{旋转模式}\n  B --&gt;|北向固定| C[地图不动]\n  C --&gt; C1[玩家箭头旋转到 θ]\n  B --&gt;|随人旋转| D[地图整体旋转 -θ]\n  D --&gt; D1[玩家箭头恒定朝上]\n  D --&gt; D2[所有标记需反向旋转补偿朝向]</pre><p>数学上，随人旋转就是在坐标变换链的归一化之后、映射到像素之前，插入一个旋转矩阵。设玩家朝向角为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（世界坐标系中相对北的夹角），随人旋转要把世界整体转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，旋转矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(-\\theta) = \\begin{bmatrix} \\cos\\theta &amp; \\sin\\theta \\\\ -\\sin\\theta &amp; \\cos\\theta \\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>作用在归一化偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}&#x27; = R(-\\theta)\\,\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再乘控件半宽落到像素。北向固定则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，此步为恒等变换，玩家箭头的图标自身旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标记的反向旋转-随人模式的隐藏成本\">标记的反向旋转：随人模式的隐藏成本</h2><p>随人旋转有一个容易被忽略、却几乎必踩的坑：<strong>有朝向的标记必须反向旋转补偿</strong>。当整张地图转了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，图上一个「箭头指向北方的兴趣点」也会跟着转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，于是它就不再指北了。为了让这个箭头在世界意义上仍指北，必须给它的图标单独再转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 抵消。</p>\n<p>反过来，<strong>无朝向的标记（圆点、图标）不能补偿</strong>，它们本就该随地图转到新位置。所以随人旋转模式下，标记要按「是否有语义朝向」分成两类差别处理：位置全部随地图旋转，而朝向类图标的自转要减去地图旋转量。这也是为什么随人旋转的实现比北向固定复杂得多——北向固定下地图不转，标记逻辑最简单。这层复杂度会传导到 <a href=\"../markers/markers-icons\">标记与图标</a> 的图标管理。此外还有文字标签：无论哪种模式，标签文字通常都要保持水平（不随地图转），否则会出现倒着的字，无法阅读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"体验差异-寻路效率与空间记忆的权衡\">体验差异：寻路效率与空间记忆的权衡</h2><p>选哪种模式不是审美，而有实证的认知权衡，核心是一对矛盾：</p>\n<p><strong>随人旋转利于即时寻路</strong>。因为「地图上方 = 我前方」，玩家不需要做任何心理旋转就能把图上的方向对应到操作方向——要去的目标在图上偏右，就往右打方向。人类导航研究一致表明，与前进方向对齐（forward-up aligned）的地图能显著降低寻路时的反应时间和错误率，尤其对空间能力较弱的玩家。车载导航几乎全默认车头朝上，正是这个道理。</p>\n<p><strong>北向固定利于建立稳定的空间记忆（巡览知识）</strong>。因为地图方向恒定，玩家每次看到的世界布局都一致，容易在脑中沉淀出一张稳定的认知地图，记住「城堡在世界的西北角」这种绝对方位。随人旋转下地图时刻在转，玩家很难形成稳定的绝对方位感，往往只有相对的即时方向感。</p>\n<p>下表把权衡量化对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>北向固定</th>\n<th>随人旋转</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时寻路（对齐操作）</td>\n<td>需心理旋转，较慢</td>\n<td>直接对应，快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间记忆（绝对方位）</td>\n<td>强，易建认知地图</td>\n<td>弱，方向感相对化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（标记反旋转）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>眩晕风险</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（地图持续旋转）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>策略、大地图 RPG</td>\n<td>FPS、赛车、动作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"眩晕-可读性与折中方案\">眩晕、可读性与折中方案</h2><p>随人旋转还有两个副作用。其一是<strong>旋转带来的视觉不适</strong>：一张持续旋转的地图在余光里是一个不停转动的元素，对前庭敏感的玩家可能诱发轻微不适，这与相机运动引发的晕动（motion sickness）同源，属于无障碍关注点。其二是<strong>旋转时的画质</strong>：若底图是预烘焙纹理（见 <a href=\"render-approaches\">渲染方式</a>），旋转会引入采样锯齿，需要开各向异性过滤或用矢量绘制规避。</p>\n<p>因此现实里出现了不少折中方案：（1）<strong>让玩家自己选</strong>——设置项里给「地图旋转」开关，是最稳妥的做法，也是无障碍最佳实践；（2）<strong>分级混合</strong>——小地图随人旋转（利即时寻路），全屏大地图北向固定（利全局规划），《巫师3》等即如此；（3）<strong>阻尼旋转</strong>——地图旋转不瞬时跟随而是加阻尼平滑，减轻眩晕但增加实现复杂度。选择应回到 <a href=\"../foundations/minimap-archetypes\">类型谱系</a> 定的游戏定位：情境意识/即时操作为主选随人，全局策略/空间记忆为主选北向，拿不准就给玩家开关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两种旋转模式的数学差异在坐标变换链里体现为<strong>是否插入旋转矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(-\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：北向固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>、玩家箭头自转；随人旋转把地图转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>随人旋转的隐藏成本是<strong>有朝向的标记必须反向补偿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>、无朝向标记不补偿、文字标签始终保持水平，实现显著更复杂。</li>\n<li>核心权衡：随人旋转<strong>利即时寻路</strong>（方向对齐操作），北向固定<strong>利空间记忆</strong>（绝对方位稳定）。</li>\n<li>随人旋转有眩晕与旋转采样画质副作用；成熟方案是给玩家开关、或小地图随人+大地图北向的分级混合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>旋转是 <a href=\"projection-scaling\">投影与缩放</a> 变换链第二步的展开，两篇合读得到完整坐标运算。</li>\n<li>标记的朝向补偿细节见 <a href=\"../markers/markers-icons\">标记与图标</a>；离屏指示同样受旋转影响，见 <a href=\"../markers/edge-clamping\">边缘裁剪与离屏指示</a>。</li>\n<li>旋转眩晕属无障碍议题，见 <a href=\"../practice/minimap-accessibility\">可读性与无障碍</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：地图旋转与相机世界坐标空间的对齐见 <a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/foundations/camera-coordinate-spaces\">相机系统 · 相机坐标空间</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"旋转模式：北向固定与随人旋转的取舍","id":"旋转模式-北向固定与随人旋转的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种模式的定义与数学","id":"核心概念-两种模式的定义与数学"},{"level":2,"text":"标记的反向旋转：随人模式的隐藏成本","id":"标记的反向旋转-随人模式的隐藏成本"},{"level":2,"text":"体验差异：寻路效率与空间记忆的权衡","id":"体验差异-寻路效率与空间记忆的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"眩晕、可读性与折中方案","id":"眩晕-可读性与折中方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"投影与缩放：正交映射与多分辨率适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-minimap-systems/rendering/projection-scaling"},"next":{"title":"标记与图标：blip 的分层、聚类与图集管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-minimap-systems/markers/markers-icons"}}